        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "01f53f40-13ff-54f5-a31a-634b5f7e6343",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Topics: NBA high school draftees, NBA draft eligibility\n- People: Brandon Jennings, Emmanuel Mudiay, Satnam Singh Bhamara, Thon Maker\n- Organizations: National Basketball Association, Milwaukee Bucks\n- Places: Italy, China\n\nFacts:\n- NBA high school draftees are players drafted into the National Basketball Association directly from high school without playing college basketball.\n- NBA draft eligibility does not require a player to spend at least one year in college basketball.\n- Brandon Jennings chose to play in Italy instead of college before entering the NBA draft.\n- Emmanuel Mudiay chose to play in China instead of college before entering the NBA draft.\n- Satnam Singh Bhamara took a year off instead of playing college basketball before entering the NBA draft.\n- Thon Maker held himself back one year in high school before declaring for the NBA draft.\n- Thon Maker, born on 25 February 1997, is a Sudanese-born Australian professional basketball player for the Milwaukee Bucks of the National Basketball Association.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "9a020d51-46a4-5e16-bb88-0c06af14a6bb",
        "text": "Page: NBA high school draftees. Sentence: The NBA high school draftees are players who have been drafted to the National Basketball Association (NBA) straight out of high school without playing basketball at the collegiate level.\nPage: NBA high school draftees. Sentence: Contrary to popular belief, the player does not have to play at least a year in college basketball, as the player can choose to instead play in another professional league (especially overseas) like Brandon Jennings or Emmanuel Mudiay in Italy and China respectively, simply take the year off, such as the case with Satnam Singh Bhamara, or even hold themselves back a year in high school before declaring for the draft, such as the case with Thon Maker.\nPage: Thon Maker. Sentence: Thon Marial Maker (born 25 February 1997) is a Sudanese-born Australian professional basketball player for the Milwaukee Bucks of the National Basketball Association (NBA).",
